  "draft_py": "# Chandra, Flame's Fury (M20)\n# [+1]: Chandra deals 2 damage to any target.                               (compiled[0])\n# [-2]: Chandra deals 4 damage to target creature and 2 damage to that creature's controller.\n# [-8]: Chandra deals 10 damage to target player and each creature that player controls.\n\n# \"that creature's controller\" / \"that player\": an anaphoric read of the ability's one target\n# (CONTROLLER_IS with a referent='target' Selector, the Chandra's Incinerator shape), never a\n# second target slot.\n_the_target = Selector(\n    count=QConst(value=1),\n    mode=SelectorMode.CHOOSE,\n    filter=FAnd(children=()),\n    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.ANY, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n    referent='target',\n)\n\nminus_two = ActivatedAbility(\n    cost=Cost(parts=(CostLoyalty(delta=-2),)),\n    effect=Seq(\n        steps=(\n            A(Verb.DEAL_DAMAGE, {\n                'amount': QConst(value=4),\n                'target': Selector(\n                    count=QConst(value=1),\n                    mode=SelectorMode.TARGET,\n                    filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n                    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n                ),\n            }),\n            A(Verb.DEAL_DAMAGE, {\n                'amount': QConst(value=2),\n                'target': Selector(\n                    count=QUnbounded(),\n                    mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n                    filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=_the_target),\n                    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.PLAYER, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n                ),\n            }),\n        ),\n    ),\n)\n\nminus_eight = ActivatedAbility(\n    cost=Cost(parts=(CostLoyalty(delta=-8),)),\n    effect=Seq(\n        steps=(\n            A(Verb.DEAL_DAMAGE, {\n                'amount': QConst(value=10),\n                'target': Selector(\n                    count=QConst(value=1),\n                    mode=SelectorMode.TARGET,\n                    filter=FNot(inner=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_PERMANENT)),\n                    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.PLAYER, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n                ),\n            }),\n            A(Verb.DEAL_DAMAGE, {\n                'amount': QConst(value=10),\n                'target': Selector(\n                    count=QUnbounded(),\n                    mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n                    filter=FAnd(\n                        children=(\n                            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=_the_target),\n                            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n                        ),\n                    ),\n                    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n                ),\n            }),\n        ),\n    ),\n)\n\nabilities = [compiled[0], minus_two, minus_eight, compiled[1]]\n",
